<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1864285088"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:48.331"><div begin="1:00.140" end="1:24.147" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:00.140" end="1:03.637" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.140" end="1:00.488">你的</span><span begin="1:00.488" end="1:01.105">壳</span> <span begin="1:01.105" end="1:01.353">像</span><span begin="1:01.353" end="1:01.716">钻</span><span begin="1:01.716" end="1:02.023">石</span><span begin="1:02.023" end="1:02.914">一样</span><span begin="1:02.914" end="1:03.637">硬</span></p><p begin="1:06.770" end="1:09.894" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.770" end="1:07.155">你的</span><span begin="1:07.155" end="1:07.806">心</span> <span begin="1:07.806" end="1:08.061">软</span><span begin="1:08.061" end="1:09.314">弱到无</span><span begin="1:09.314" end="1:09.894">形</span></p><p begin="1:13.520" end="1:17.193" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.520" end="1:13.913">你的</span><span begin="1:13.913" end="1:14.572">事</span> <span begin="1:14.572" end="1:14.802">像</span><span begin="1:14.802" end="1:15.191">风</span><span begin="1:15.191" end="1:15.472">雪</span><span begin="1:15.472" end="1:16.277">里的</span><span begin="1:16.277" end="1:17.193">冰</span></p><p begin="1:17.580" end="1:19.498" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.580" end="1:18.262">清醒我</span><span begin="1:18.262" end="1:18.673">至</span><span begin="1:18.673" end="1:19.498">今</span></p><p begin="1:20.400" end="1:24.147" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.400" end="1:20.903">只是</span><span begin="1:20.903" end="1:21.686">你</span> <span begin="1:21.787" end="1:22.235">有</span><span begin="1:22.235" end="1:22.442">一</span><span begin="1:22.442" end="1:23.342">点点</span><span begin="1:23.342" end="1:24.147">疼</span></p></div><div begin="1:24.810" end="1:51.676" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:24.810" end="1:26.918" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.810" end="1:25.252">听</span><span begin="1:25